- examples/models/gemini_model_example.py - Shows how to create a ChatAgent using the Gemini model with example usage.
  - Key classes/functions: ChatAgent, ModelFactory.create() with GeminiConfig and ModelType.GEMINI_3_PRO or GEMINI_3_FLASH

## Implementation
- camel/toolkits/search_toolkit.py - Implements SearchToolkit with multiple search engine methods including search_duckduckgo().
  - Classes: SearchToolkit
  - Functions: search_duckduckgo(), get_tools()

- camel/models/gemini_model.py - Implements GeminiModel class compatible with OpenAI interface, supporting tool usage.
  - Classes: GeminiModel
  - Functions: __init__(), _run(), _arun(), _request_chat_completion(), etc.

- camel/agents/chat_agent.py - Implements ChatAgent class which manages conversation, tools, memory, and model backends.
