## Configuration
- camel/configs/gemini_config.py - Configuration for Gemini model (not read but inferred from naming and usage in examples).

These files provide the core components and usage patterns needed to create an agent using the Gemini model with DuckDuckGo search tools. The example in examples/vision/duckduckgo_video_object_recognition.py shows how to use SearchToolkit's DuckDuckGo search, and examples/models/gemini_model_example.py shows how to instantiate a Gemini-based ChatAgent. The implementation files provide the underlying classes and methods to build the agent script you need.
